# Handl: Got a problem? Handl it.
Team Catalyst | IDEATHON 2026

Handl helps households find the nearest trusted local worker (plumber, electrician, carpenter, kabadiwala). Users describe a problem by text, voice or photo, and Gemini shows the worker needed and a fair price range.

## Live links
- AI Studio (full app with map): https://handlapp.ai.studio
- Render: https://handl-mxib.onrender.com
- Demo video: [paste link here]

## Features
- Animated homepage
- Phone and OTP login (simulated)
- Text, voice and photo input
- AI worker type, urgency and fair price estimate (Gemini)
- Scrap photo item list and price estimate
- Compare workers by price, arrival time, experience and rating
- Map of Kanpur with worker tracking (simulated)
- Household Trust Score, chat, Cancel and SOS
- Worker flow: Accept, status updates, rating

